{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023"],
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "strict": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "noImplicitOverride": true,
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": ["node"],
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true
  },
  "$comment": "不要在此加 noEmit：被 composite 项目引用时会报 TS6310（may not disable emit）。类型检查统一用根脚本 `tsc -b --noEmit`，已实测确认它不产出 dist，但仍生成 .tsbuildinfo（已 gitignore）。"
}
